{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Seed of Nostalgia",
    "steam_appid": 1894140,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/bfaff75f86e137138b6eea0a54fa3787.avif?t=1751994734\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>25 - 30 hours</strong> for the main story, <strong>40+</strong> with optional / end-game content.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful <strong>Pixel Art</strong> and environmental <strong>animations</strong> bring the world of Sylvara to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story that blends lighthearted adventure, with deeper symbolic and philosophical themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a <strong>vast world</strong> filled with wondrous locations and <strong>hidden secrets</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylish Retro <strong>turn-based battles</strong> that happen in the world you explore, <strong>no</strong> <strong>random encounters!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mine metals, gather materials from enemies, and <strong>craft or upgrade</strong> new weapons for even more power!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get to know the characters of the world through <strong>emotional moments</strong> and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A diverse party of <strong>8 playable characters</strong> to enlist and harness their unique class abilities, and build the way you want, with fully <strong>customizable Skill Trees</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A beautiful and <strong>nostalgia-filled soundtrack</strong> that will bring you back to the 90's golden era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full modern controller support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/aab4a488ba0d6b4075a5131b8dda8b1c.poster.avif?t=1751994734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/aab4a488ba0d6b4075a5131b8dda8b1c.webm?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/aab4a488ba0d6b4075a5131b8dda8b1c.mp4?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/1f996e50c811dcfd75b0cde9e81755e1.avif?t=1751994734\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the enchanting world of Seed of Nostalgia, ancient myths and modern magic intertwine. For centuries, the secluded village of Arboreum, nestled atop the colossal World Tree Verdan'Thala, has safeguarded the mystical Gaia Seed, the primordial source of life and balance.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atilla, a young and aspiring Spirit Blade, is about to complete his training and fulfill his duty to protect the sacred tree. However, a mysterious event disrupts his ancient Ascendance rite, and sends his village into a state of despair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/6237612b2bed65ddfc83d4b0b60b1b5c.poster.avif?t=1751994734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/6237612b2bed65ddfc83d4b0b60b1b5c.webm?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/6237612b2bed65ddfc83d4b0b60b1b5c.mp4?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the Gaia Seed begins to wither, Atilla must descend from the World Tree for the first time and journey across a land filled with wonders and dangers. Alongside a cast of unique and compelling characters\u2014including Aleister, the enigmatic Obsidian Mage; Roland, the eccentric Alchemist; Terra, the compassionate Prismatic Mage; and Hawk, the cunning Marksman\u2014Atilla seeks to uncover the truth behind the disruption and restore the life-giving power of the Gaia Seed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/7089d783089bcf1be4bc3c89c7ded9de.poster.avif?t=1751994734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/7089d783089bcf1be4bc3c89c7ded9de.webm?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/7089d783089bcf1be4bc3c89c7ded9de.mp4?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yet, shadows loom over their quest. Lord Heinrik Vandran, the enigmatic leader of a distant corrupt kingdom, seeks to unravel the world\u2019s balance, driven by a hidden agenda tied to an ancient and malevolent religion. As Atilla and his companions unravel the secrets of the Gaia Seed and the ancient temples that sustain it, they uncover a deeper conspiracy that challenges their beliefs and forces them to confront the very nature of sacrifice, duty, and destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/110ee34f17e30bd05f5fe36ac6922f71.poster.avif?t=1751994734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/110ee34f17e30bd05f5fe36ac6922f71.webm?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/110ee34f17e30bd05f5fe36ac6922f71.mp4?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seed of Nostalgia offers a rich, retro-inspired JRPG experience with stunning pixel art, engaging turn-based combat, and a heartfelt narrative. Explore lush forests, mystic deserts, and frozen mountains as you guide Atilla and his allies through a tale of hope, friendship, and the enduring power of life itself. Will you unravel the cosmic secrets that hold the keys to the worlds redemption?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/edd313099422ee10541df48141517910.poster.avif?t=1751994734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/edd313099422ee10541df48141517910.webm?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/edd313099422ee10541df48141517910.mp4?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/bfaff75f86e137138b6eea0a54fa3787.avif?t=1751994734\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Features:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>25 - 30 hours</strong> for the main story, <strong>40+</strong> with optional / end-game content.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beautiful <strong>Pixel Art</strong> and environmental <strong>animations</strong> bring the world of Sylvara to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story that blends lighthearted adventure, with deeper symbolic and philosophical themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a <strong>vast world</strong> filled with wondrous locations and <strong>hidden secrets</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylish Retro <strong>turn-based battles</strong> that happen in the world you explore, <strong>no</strong> <strong>random encounters!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mine metals, gather materials from enemies, and <strong>craft or upgrade</strong> new weapons for even more power!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get to know the characters of the world through <strong>emotional moments</strong> and environmental storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A diverse party of <strong>8 playable characters</strong> to enlist and harness their unique class abilities, and build the way you want, with fully <strong>customizable Skill Trees</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A beautiful and <strong>nostalgia-filled soundtrack</strong> that will bring you back to the 90's golden era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full modern controller support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/aab4a488ba0d6b4075a5131b8dda8b1c.poster.avif?t=1751994734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/aab4a488ba0d6b4075a5131b8dda8b1c.webm?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/aab4a488ba0d6b4075a5131b8dda8b1c.mp4?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/1f996e50c811dcfd75b0cde9e81755e1.avif?t=1751994734\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the enchanting world of Seed of Nostalgia, ancient myths and modern magic intertwine. For centuries, the secluded village of Arboreum, nestled atop the colossal World Tree Verdan'Thala, has safeguarded the mystical Gaia Seed, the primordial source of life and balance.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atilla, a young and aspiring Spirit Blade, is about to complete his training and fulfill his duty to protect the sacred tree. However, a mysterious event disrupts his ancient Ascendance rite, and sends his village into a state of despair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/6237612b2bed65ddfc83d4b0b60b1b5c.poster.avif?t=1751994734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/6237612b2bed65ddfc83d4b0b60b1b5c.webm?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/6237612b2bed65ddfc83d4b0b60b1b5c.mp4?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the Gaia Seed begins to wither, Atilla must descend from the World Tree for the first time and journey across a land filled with wonders and dangers. Alongside a cast of unique and compelling characters\u2014including Aleister, the enigmatic Obsidian Mage; Roland, the eccentric Alchemist; Terra, the compassionate Prismatic Mage; and Hawk, the cunning Marksman\u2014Atilla seeks to uncover the truth behind the disruption and restore the life-giving power of the Gaia Seed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/7089d783089bcf1be4bc3c89c7ded9de.poster.avif?t=1751994734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/7089d783089bcf1be4bc3c89c7ded9de.webm?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/7089d783089bcf1be4bc3c89c7ded9de.mp4?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yet, shadows loom over their quest. Lord Heinrik Vandran, the enigmatic leader of a distant corrupt kingdom, seeks to unravel the world\u2019s balance, driven by a hidden agenda tied to an ancient and malevolent religion. As Atilla and his companions unravel the secrets of the Gaia Seed and the ancient temples that sustain it, they uncover a deeper conspiracy that challenges their beliefs and forces them to confront the very nature of sacrifice, duty, and destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/110ee34f17e30bd05f5fe36ac6922f71.poster.avif?t=1751994734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/110ee34f17e30bd05f5fe36ac6922f71.webm?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/110ee34f17e30bd05f5fe36ac6922f71.mp4?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seed of Nostalgia offers a rich, retro-inspired JRPG experience with stunning pixel art, engaging turn-based combat, and a heartfelt narrative. Explore lush forests, mystic deserts, and frozen mountains as you guide Atilla and his allies through a tale of hope, friendship, and the enduring power of life itself. Will you unravel the cosmic secrets that hold the keys to the worlds redemption?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/edd313099422ee10541df48141517910.poster.avif?t=1751994734\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/edd313099422ee10541df48141517910.webm?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1894140/extras/edd313099422ee10541df48141517910.mp4?t=1751994734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Seed of Nostalgia is a beautiful pixel art JRPG which follows the tale of Atilla and a cast of intriguing characters on a quest to save their dying world. Explore a mystical land, unravel dark secrets, and confront ancient forces in a tale of magic, sacrifice, and unexpected revelations.",
